# Paradise of Ross · റോസിന്റെ പറുദീസ

> എന്റെ മനസ്സിൽ വിരിഞ്ഞ ചിന്തകൾക്കും, ഞാൻ പഠിച്ച പാഠങ്ങൾക്കും, ഹൃദയത്തോട് ചേർത്തുവെച്ച ഓർമ്മകൾക്കുമായി ഒരു ചെറിയ സ്വർഗ്ഗം.

A small, growing home for memories, travels, celebrations, thanks and reflections, written in Malayalam with love.

**Live site:** https://paradiseofross-dotcom.github.io/paradise-of-ross/

## About

Paradise of Ross is a personal website of written memories. The notes are composed in text, kept safe here, and read back whenever they are needed. New pages are added as each memory is finished.

The site is plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. There is no build step and nothing to install.

## Features

- Soft background piano music (made in the browser, no audio files), with a Play / Pause button in the top right corner
- Gentle animations: fading entrances, drifting rose petals, scroll reveals
- Light and dark appearance, following the visitor's device setting
- Works on phones and computers
- Respects the "reduce motion" setting for visitors who prefer it

