## Adding a new memory

1. Create the new page inside the `memories` folder, for example `memories/new-story.html`.
2. Open `memories/ormakal.html`, find the comment `ADD NEW STORIES BELOW THIS LINE`, copy the sample block and change the number, file name, title and description.
3. Commit the changes. The site updates in a minute or two.

## Link rules

Broken links show a 404 page, so keep these in mind:

- Pages inside `memories/` link to the home page with `../index.html`.
- The home page links to pages inside `memories/` with `memories/file-name.html`.
- File names are case sensitive. Use lowercase letters, hyphens and `.html` only once.
- After a change, press `Ctrl + F5` to see the latest version.

